  "paragraph": 22,
  "text": "Choosing between the two is straightforward. Reach for local standard input and output whenever you need direct, low-latency access to files sitting on your laptop with zero network traffic. Reach for remote Streamable HTTP whenever you want effortless cloud integrations with no terminal setup, or when an organization wants to host one centrally managed server for easy team sharing.",
